cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this work, please cite it as below.
title: 'GenomePlatform: automated bacterial genomic analysis with AI-assisted clinical interpretation'
type: software
authors:
- given-names: Gültekin
  family-names: Ünal
  orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8996-7028
  affiliation: Ankara University, Faculty of Veterinary Medicine, Department of Microbiology
abstract: A FastAPI-based platform that runs a bacterial genome analysis chain (QC, assembly,
  MLST, AMR detection, annotation) from a single upload and renders the results as a report,
  with an AI-generated narrative summary and PCR primer design support. Research use only;
  not validated for in vitro diagnostic use.
repository-code: https://github.com/cinnetcrash/GenomePlatform
url: https://github.com/cinnetcrash/GenomePlatform
license: MIT
keywords:
- bacterial genomics
- clinical microbiology
- antimicrobial resistance
- MLST
- FastAPI
- PCR primer design
